<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lomak Petroleum started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lomak Petroleum started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst David Wheeler said on Friday he had started coverage of Lomak Petroleum Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a telephone conversation with Reuters, Wheeler declined to provide details of the ratings decision.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Fort Worth, Texas, company closed on Wednesday at 19-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
